{"id": "t111-001", "text": "Layla's picking up the new puppy on 14 Nov, a cockapoo called Biscuit. She's taking the whole week off work afterwards to settle him in.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "picking up the new puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cockapoo called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "whole week off work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-003", "text": "Jen said her cat Pickle has kidney problems, vet wants bloods redone 3rd of December. she's pretty upset about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pickle", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "kidney problems", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bloods redone", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of December", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-004", "text": "Rin starts at Deloitte on 6/01. Ask her how the first week went the friday after. She's a bit nervous because it's a big step up from the small firm, and her manager there, a guy called Lars, apparently has a reputation. Her partner Jen is throwing her a little send-off at theirs on the 3rd", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at Deloitte", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/01", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask her how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the friday after", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a reputation", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "little send-off at theirs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-005", "text": "so Yosef and his wife Mai are doing a joint thing for their kids' birthdays, both on the 22nd, soft play then pizza. his mum's flying in from Haifa the day before to help. I said I'd bring the cake, I'm doing a caterpillar one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint thing", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthdays", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 22nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Haifa", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day before", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t111-010", "text": "Andre's leaving drinks were meant to be next Thursday but they've been called off, he's staying on another three months after all", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying on", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "another three months", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t111-012", "text": "Just got off the phone with Mohammed. His daughter Amara got into Manchester for medicine, they're over the moon. She starts in September. He kept saying she'd worked so hard for it. Must get her something small to celebrate, maybe a nice stethoscope or a voucher for the uni bookshop", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mohammed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into Manchester for medicine", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get her something small to celebrate", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t111-015", "text": "Yasmin's brother Eli is getting married 12 April in Lisbon. she's maid of honour and stressing about the speech. hen do is the weekend before. Eli's fiancee Keisha wants something low-key, so they're thinking spa day not Magaluf. Yasmin asked if I'd read the speech over, said I would. Their mum is making the dress herself which is apparently causing drama", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12 April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "maid of honour", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p4", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend before", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "fiancee", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants something low-key", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t111-021", "text": "Lars from the client side mentioned his son Mateo has a cello recital Saturday. Seemed proud. Kid's only 9. Lars said afterwards there's a dinner with the Santos team on 2nd of Dec and he'd like me there too. Need to email Lars the agenda by Monday, and mention the recital, he'll like that", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from the client side", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cello recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "only 9", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p1b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner with the Santos team", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of Dec", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Lars the agenda", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1c", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Monday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "mention the recital", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t111-025", "text": "had coffee with Layla. she's been struggling since the restructure, her new manager Andile keeps moving her deadlines. Thinks she might start looking elsewhere in the new year. She also mentioned her mum's hip replacement is on the 2nd of Dec and she'll be up in Durham for a week after to look after her. Should check in on her once she's back", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d0", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the restructure"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "manager", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andile", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "start looking elsewhere", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip replacement", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of Dec", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "up in Durham", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in on her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t111-027", "text": "Jen's cat is back from the vet, all fine. She's taking him for another check a week after the antibiotics finish", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "check", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week after the antibiotics finish", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t111-034", "text": "Andre's dad's 70th is on Saturday, the whole family's going for lunch in Brighton. Andre is giving a speech and he's already panicking about it lol", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "70th", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch in Brighton", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p1b", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Andre", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "speech", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-039", "text": "Zainab's sister Mai had her baby on the 9th, little girl called Nour. 3.2kg. Zainab's an aunty now, she's so excited", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "little girl", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nour", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zainab", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "aunty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-041", "text": "Wei's working from Singapore for a month from 1 Nov, client project. Her cat Mochi's staying with her brother", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Wei", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "working from Singapore", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from 1 Nov", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t111-042", "text": "Ivan said he passed!! finally. picking up his first car next weekend", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ivan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first car", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t111-043", "text": "Zoe Thomas new on my team from Monday, coming over from the Leeds office. Lars wants me to buddy her for the first fortnight. Should take her for lunch on day one", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe Thomas", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new on my team", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coming over from the Leeds office", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lars", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first fortnight"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her for lunch", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "day one", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t111-048", "text": "Anika had the baby! boy, Rafi, born on the 10th. send a card and the present Keisha organised", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafi", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 10th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a card and the present Keisha organised", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t111-049", "text": "Keisha's boyfriend Mateo proposed in Rome last weekend. Wedding probably next summer. She wants to keep it small", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "proposed in Rome", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "probably next summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to keep it small", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t111-055", "text": "Yosef's mum is staying with them for three weeks. He's finding it a lot", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yosef", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with them", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it a lot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t111-056", "text": "Antoine's mum Amara Adeyemi turns 60 on the 2nd of March, surprise party at their house. he's asked everyone to keep it quiet. I'm bringing the jollof", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Antoine", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Amara Adeyemi", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns 60", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 2nd of March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise party at their house", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
